OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FGusty winds  
OL,6,Fsteadily ease for most, lingering      
OL,7,Falong southern coasts. In Cornwall,    
OL,8,Fheavy rain continues but starts to     
OL,9,Fslowly ease in the morning. It will be 
OL,10,Fcloudy overnight with a chilly feel    
OL,11,Fcompared to Monday night and patchy    
OL,12,Ffrost.                                 
OL,14,CWednesday:FThere will be low cloud     
OL,15,Fsweeping through the region with       
OL,16,Fpatchy rain, but outside of this sunny 
OL,17,Fspells, especially by the afternoon.   
OL,18,FFeeling chillier than Tuesday with a   
OL,19,Fgentle breeze.                         
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
